IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg2-support`
IMPORT `dg2-interested-definitions`
IMPORT `dg2-interested-transactions`

-- Tests of dg2-interested-transactions.l4 (8 Del. C. section 144(a) to (d)). Expected values are written by hand from src:394 to src:418
-- of de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, beside each assertion, before the run.

§ `The vote of the disinterested stockholders, and section 144(d)(7)`

-- (an offer contemplated by section 251(h), informed, uncoerced, votes cast, votes in favor, shares irrevocably accepted, shares not accepted)
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A NUMBER
      e IS A NUMBER
      f IS A NUMBER
      g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `s 144 Votes of the disinterested stockholders`
`a stockholder vote` a b c d e f g MEANS `s 144 Votes of the disinterested stockholders` WITH
    `the act or transaction is an offer contemplated by section 251(h)` IS a
    `the vote was informed` IS b
    `the vote was uncoerced` IS c
    `the votes cast by the disinterested stockholders` IS d
    `the votes cast in favor by the disinterested stockholders` IS e
    `the number of shares irrevocably accepted for purchase or exchange pursuant to the offer` IS f
    `the number of shares owned or controlled by disinterested stockholders not irrevocably accepted for purchase or exchange pursuant to the offer` IS g

-- src:418: for an offer under section 251(h), shares irrevocably accepted are deemed voted in favor and the disinterested stockholders' shares not
-- accepted are deemed voted against; 60 accepted and 30 not accepted make 90 cast and 60 in favor. Otherwise the votes actually cast.
#ASSERT (`s 144(d)(7) the votes counted` (`a stockholder vote` TRUE TRUE TRUE 100 51 60 30))'s `the votes counted as cast` EQUALS 90
#ASSERT (`s 144(d)(7) the votes counted` (`a stockholder vote` TRUE TRUE TRUE 100 51 60 30))'s `the votes counted as cast in favor` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT (`s 144(d)(7) the votes counted` (`a stockholder vote` FALSE TRUE TRUE 100 51 60 30))'s `the votes counted as cast` EQUALS 100
#ASSERT (`s 144(d)(7) the votes counted` (`a stockholder vote` FALSE TRUE TRUE 100 51 60 30))'s `the votes counted as cast in favor` EQUALS 51

-- src:397: an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast by the disinterested stockholders: 51 of 100 is, 50 of 100 is not.
#ASSERT `s 144(a)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved or ratified by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` (`a stockholder vote` FALSE TRUE TRUE 100 51 0 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(a)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved or ratified by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` (`a stockholder vote` FALSE TRUE TRUE 100 50 0 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(a)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved or ratified by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` (`a stockholder vote` FALSE FALSE TRUE 100 90 0 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(a)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved or ratified by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` (`a stockholder vote` FALSE TRUE FALSE 100 90 0 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- An offer under section 251(h): 60 of 90 deemed cast carries; 45 of 90 is half, so not.
#ASSERT `s 144(a)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved or ratified by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` (`a stockholder vote` TRUE TRUE TRUE 0 0 60 30) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(a)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved or ratified by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` (`a stockholder vote` TRUE TRUE TRUE 0 0 45 45) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No votes cast: not covered, unless the vote was already not informed (then FALSE).
#ASSERT `s 144(a)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved or ratified by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` (`a stockholder vote` FALSE TRUE TRUE 0 0 0 0) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 144(a)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved or ratified by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` (`a stockholder vote` FALSE FALSE TRUE 0 0 0 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 144(a)`

-- (involves a director or officer, involves an entity of a director or officer, is a controlling stockholder transaction, material facts disclosed,
-- good faith, without gross negligence, disinterested directors serving, of them in favor, directors on the board, of them disinterested,
-- committee of 2 or more disinterested directors approved, the vote of the disinterested stockholders, fair)
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A NUMBER
      h IS A NUMBER
      i IS A NUMBER
      j IS A NUMBER
      k IS A BOOLEAN
      l IS A `s 144 Votes of the disinterested stockholders`
      m IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 144(a) Facts`
`an interested transaction` a b c d e f g h i j k l m MEANS `s 144(a) Facts` WITH
    `the act or transaction involves or is between the corporation or 1 or more of its subsidiaries and 1 or more of the corporation's directors or officers` IS a
    `the act or transaction involves or is between the corporation or 1 or more of its subsidiaries and another entity in which 1 or more of its directors or officers are directors, stockholders, partners, managers, members, or officers, or have a financial interest` IS b
    `the act or transaction is a controlling stockholder transaction under subsection (b) or (c)` IS c
    `the material facts as to the director's or officer's relationship or interest and as to the act or transaction are disclosed or are known to all members of the board of directors or committee` IS d
    `the board of directors or committee authorized the act or transaction in good faith` IS e
    `the board of directors or committee authorized the act or transaction without gross negligence` IS f
    `the number of disinterested directors then serving on the board of directors or committee that authorized the act or transaction` IS g
    `the number of those disinterested directors who voted in favor` IS h
    `the number of directors then serving on the board of directors` IS i
    `the number of those directors who are disinterested directors with respect to the act or transaction` IS j
    `a committee of 2 or more directors, each of whom the board has determined to be a disinterested director with respect to the act or transaction, approved or recommended it` IS k
    `the votes of the disinterested stockholders` IS l
    `the act or transaction is fair as to the corporation and the corporation's stockholders` IS m

`no stockholder vote was taken` MEANS `a stockholder vote` FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 0 0
`an approving stockholder vote of 51 of 100` MEANS `a stockholder vote` FALSE TRUE TRUE 100 51 0 0

-- (a)(1): 3 disinterested directors serve and 2 approve (a majority); the board has 5, 3 disinterested, so a majority of the directors are
-- disinterested and the proviso does not apply.
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 1 of 3 is not a majority.
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 1 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "even though the disinterested directors be less than a quorum": 2 disinterested of a board of 9. A majority of the directors are not
-- disinterested (7 of 9), so the proviso requires approval by a committee of 2 or more directors determined to be disinterested.
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 2 2 9 2 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 2 2 9 2 TRUE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Exactly half of the directors not disinterested (2 of 4) is not "a majority of the directors", so no proviso.
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 2 2 4 2 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Disclosure, good faith, absence of gross negligence are each required.
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE 3 2 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE 3 2 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE 3 2 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a)(2) alone, (a)(3) alone: the limbs are alternatives.
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 3 0 5 3 FALSE `an approving stockholder vote of 51 of 100` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 3 0 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The text covers an act or transaction with a director or officer or with an entity of theirs: neither is not covered. A controlling stockholder transaction is for (b) and (c).
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Counts that cannot be a vote, with nothing else made out: not covered.
#ASSERT `s 144(a) the act or transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages against a director or officer` (`an interested transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 0 0 5 3 FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 144(b) and (c)`

-- (a controlling stockholder transaction, a going private transaction, material facts disclosed or known to all members of the committee,
-- the board expressly delegated the authority to negotiate and to reject, good faith, without gross negligence, disinterested directors on the
-- committee, of them approving, the committee has 2 or more directors each determined to be disinterested, conditioned on disinterested
-- stockholders' approval, the vote of the disinterested stockholders, fair)
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A NUMBER
      h IS A NUMBER
      i IS A BOOLEAN
      j IS A BOOLEAN
      k IS A `s 144 Votes of the disinterested stockholders`
      l IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 144(b) Facts`
`a controlling stockholder transaction` a b c d e f g h i j k l MEANS `s 144(b) Facts` WITH
    `the act or transaction is a controlling stockholder transaction` IS a
    `the act or transaction is a going private transaction` IS b
    `the material facts as to the controlling stockholder transaction, including the controlling stockholder's or control group's interest, are disclosed or are known to all members of the committee` IS c
    `the board of directors expressly delegated to the committee the authority to negotiate (or oversee the negotiation of) and to reject the controlling stockholder transaction` IS d
    `the committee approved or recommended the transaction in good faith` IS e
    `the committee approved or recommended the transaction without gross negligence` IS f
    `the number of disinterested directors then serving on the committee` IS g
    `the number of those disinterested directors who approved or recommended the transaction` IS h
    `the committee consists of 2 or more directors, each of whom the board has determined to be a disinterested director with respect to the transaction` IS i
    `the transaction is conditioned, by its terms as in effect at the time it is submitted to stockholders, on approval or ratification by disinterested stockholders` IS j
    `the votes of the disinterested stockholders` IS k
    `the transaction is fair as to the corporation and the corporation's stockholders` IS l

-- (b)(1): all conditions on the committee, 2 of 3 disinterested directors approving.
#ASSERT `s 144(b)(1) the committee of disinterested directors approved the controlling stockholder transaction` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 TRUE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(b)(1) the committee of disinterested directors approved the controlling stockholder transaction` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 1 TRUE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(b)(1) the committee of disinterested directors approved the controlling stockholder transaction` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE 3 2 TRUE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(b)(1) the committee of disinterested directors approved the controlling stockholder transaction` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 FALSE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(b)(1) the committee of disinterested directors approved the controlling stockholder transaction` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 TRUE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b)(2): conditioned by its terms AND approved by the informed, uncoerced majority of the votes cast.
#ASSERT `s 144(b)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved the controlling stockholder transaction as it conditioned` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE TRUE `an approving stockholder vote of 51 of 100` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(b)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved the controlling stockholder transaction as it conditioned` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE `an approving stockholder vote of 51 of 100` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(b)(2) the disinterested stockholders approved the controlling stockholder transaction as it conditioned` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE TRUE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (b): any one limb protects a controlling stockholder transaction that is not a going private transaction.
#ASSERT `s 144(b) the controlling stockholder transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 TRUE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(b) the controlling stockholder transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE TRUE `an approving stockholder vote of 51 of 100` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(b) the controlling stockholder transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(b) the controlling stockholder transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A going private transaction is for (c); a transaction that is not a controlling stockholder transaction is for (a).
#ASSERT `s 144(b) the controlling stockholder transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 144(b) the controlling stockholder transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- (c): a going private transaction is protected by (b)(1) AND (b)(2) together, or by fairness.
#ASSERT `s 144(c) the going private transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 TRUE TRUE `an approving stockholder vote of 51 of 100` FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(c) the going private transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 2 TRUE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(c) the going private transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE TRUE `an approving stockholder vote of 51 of 100` FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(c) the going private transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(c) the going private transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 144(c) the going private transaction may not be the subject of equitable relief or give rise to damages on a fiduciary claim` (`a controlling stockholder transaction` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 0 FALSE FALSE `no stockholder vote was taken` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 144(d)`

#ASSERT `s 144(d)(1) common or interested directors may be counted in determining the presence of a quorum` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(1) common or interested directors may be counted in determining the presence of a quorum` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (d)(2): presumed disinterested if the corporation has a listed class of stock, the director is not a party, and the board determined the director independent.
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(2) the director is presumed to be a disinterested director` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(d)(2) the director is presumed to be a disinterested director` FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(d)(2) the director is presumed to be a disinterested director` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(d)(2) the director is presumed to be a disinterested director` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(2) the presumption is rebutted` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(2) the presumption is rebutted` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(d)(2) the presumption is rebutted` FALSE FALSE

-- (d)(3): designation, nomination or a vote by a person with a material interest is not, of itself, evidence.
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(d)(3) the designation, nomination or vote is of itself evidence that the director is not a disinterested director` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(d)(3) the designation, nomination or vote is of itself evidence that the director is not a disinterested director` FALSE

-- (d)(4): the criteria of section 144(e)(2) and (1).
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `s 144(e)(2) Facts about a person's control`
`a person holding a of b votes and nothing else` a b MEANS `s 144(e)(2) Facts about a person's control` WITH
    `the voting power in the election of directors that the person owns or controls, together with its affiliates and associates` IS a
    `the voting power in the election of directors of all the outstanding stock entitled to vote generally in the election of directors` IS b
    `the person owns or controls a majority in voting power in the election of directors who have a majority in voting power of the votes of all directors` IS FALSE
    `the person has the right, by contract or otherwise, to cause the election of nominees selected at its discretion who constitute a majority of the board of directors or directors entitled to cast a majority in voting power of the votes of all directors` IS FALSE
    `the person owns or controls at least 1/3 in voting power in the election of directors who have a majority in voting power of the votes of all directors` IS FALSE
    `the person has the power to exercise managerial authority over the business and affairs of the corporation` IS FALSE

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 144(e)(1) Facts about a group of persons`
`a group of a persons` a b c d MEANS `s 144(e)(1) Facts about a group of persons` WITH
    `the number of persons in the group` IS a
    `none of the persons is a controlling stockholder` IS b
    `the persons are bound together by an agreement, arrangement, or understanding between or among them` IS c
    `by virtue of that agreement, arrangement, or understanding the persons constitute a controlling stockholder` IS d

#ASSERT `s 144(d)(4) the person may be deemed a controlling stockholder` (`a person holding a of b votes and nothing else` 51 100) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(4) the person may be deemed a controlling stockholder` (`a person holding a of b votes and nothing else` 20 100) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(4) the persons may be a control group` (`a group of a persons` 2 TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 144(d)(4) the persons may be a control group` (`a group of a persons` 2 TRUE FALSE TRUE)

-- (d)(5): a controlling stockholder or member of a control group is shielded from monetary damages, except for a loyalty breach, bad faith, or improper benefit.
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(5) the person is shielded from monetary damages for the breach` TRUE `a breach of the duty of loyalty to the corporation or the other stockholders` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(5) the person is shielded from monetary damages for the breach` TRUE `acts or omissions not in good faith or which involve intentional misconduct or a knowing violation of law` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(5) the person is shielded from monetary damages for the breach` TRUE `a transaction from which the person derived an improper personal benefit` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(5) the person is shielded from monetary damages for the breach` TRUE `a breach of fiduciary duty of any other kind` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(5) the person is shielded from monetary damages for the breach` FALSE `a breach of fiduciary duty of any other kind` EQUALS NOTHING

-- (d)(6): subsections (a), (b) and (c) do not limit these grounds; any other ground is not mentioned.
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(6) subsections (a), (b) and (c) leave the right to seek relief on the ground open` `that the act or transaction was not authorized or approved in compliance with the procedures set forth in this chapter` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(6) subsections (a), (b) and (c) leave the right to seek relief on the ground open` `that the act or transaction was not authorized or approved in compliance with the certificate of incorporation or bylaws` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(6) subsections (a), (b) and (c) leave the right to seek relief on the ground open` `that the act or transaction is in violation of a plan, agreement, or order of a governmental authority to which the corporation is a party or subject` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(6) subsections (a), (b) and (c) leave the right to seek relief on the ground open` `that a provision or device is designed or intended to deter, delay, or preclude a change of control or other transaction or a change in the composition of the board, and injunctive relief is sought` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(6) subsections (a), (b) and (c) leave the right to seek relief on the ground open` `that a stockholder or other person knowingly aided and abetted a breach of fiduciary duty by 1 or more of the directors` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 144(d)(6) subsections (a), (b) and (c) leave the right to seek relief on the ground open` `a ground of any other kind` EQUALS NOTHING
